B = [
('Guinness','Europe','1930s-present','beverages','In the style of Guinness, heritage solidity in near-black and gold. Deep glossy black grounds with a creamy tan-white crown of contrast, set against cream or off-white panels framed by thin gold borders. A single gold emblem in profile sits dead centre, with restrained thin black serif capitals and gold-on-black embossing. Layouts are symmetrical, orderly and traditional. A secondary playful vein uses flat, bright gouache-like illustration in yellow, blue and red with chunky hand-drawn lettering and whimsical creatures. Mood is dignified, rich, warm and unmistakably Irish.'),
('Heineken','Europe','1960s-present','beverages','In the style of Heineken, crisp, clean and friendly European branding built on deep emerald green, bright red and white with silver accents. A bold red five-pointed star is the central, repeatable emblem, often set on a cream-white oval edged in red. Lettering is lowercase, rounded sans-serif with a slightly tilted letter and a thin red outline, sitting in a white curved banner. Thin gold or red filigree trim may edge panels. Surfaces are glossy and uncluttered, with green dominating and the red star popping against it.'),
('Cadbury','Europe','1920s-present','confectionery','In the style of Cadbury, a rich, deep royal purple dominates every surface, in glossy foil and paper finishes. A flowing gold script in thick looping cursive lettering is the signature mark, often carried on a swooping ribbon swirl in white or gold. Cream and white accents, gold borders, ribbon bows, rounded friendly curves and soft chocolate swirl graphics add generosity. Surfaces can be moulded into regular blocks with the cursive mark embossed. Warm, traditional, comforting and indulgent British sweetness.'),
('Toblerone','Europe','1900s-present','confectionery','In the style of Toblerone, forms built from repeating triangular peaks, like a row of mountains, with sawtooth silhouettes and sloping sides. Warm honey-gold and cream-yellow fields carry deep blue lettering bands, brown and dark blue serif and rounded sans lettering, and white snow-capped highlights. A mountain silhouette emblem hides a secret figure in its negative space. Silver foil, light embossing and clean pyramid repetition give a tidy, geometric rhythm. Mood is Alpine, Swiss, clean, wholesome and cleverly witty.'),
('Kinder','Europe','1970s-present','confectionery','In the style of Kinder, cheerful, safe, child-friendly design in clean white and bright red with accents of blue and warm yellow. A smiling cartoon child face is the mascot, framed in a red halo. Lettering is bold, red and rounded. Stripes, milk-splash shapes in white and blue, glossy red-and-white foil and soft egg-like rounded forms keep everything playful and tidy. Small surprises of bright colour are tucked inside plain wrapping. Bold, wholesome, clean and joyful, with a friendly face on every surface.'),
('Hershey','North America','1900s-present','confectionery','In the style of Hershey, plain, sturdy, warm American everyday design in a monochrome deep chocolate-brown field with silver or white lettering. Bold condensed sans-serif capitals run horizontally across the surface. Silver foil inner wraps, flat segmented rectangles with raised square grids, and teardrop forms with a flat base and a small paper flag plume. Occasional red or gold accents mark seasonal variations. Minimal decoration, solid and dependable, like classic drugstore sweets with a nostalgic, unfussy honesty.'),
('Haribo','Europe','1960s-present','confectionery','In the style of Haribo, bright, cheerful primary-colour German retro fun. Transparent window packs show glossy translucent jewel-coloured shapes in red, green, yellow, orange and white, with a sugar-dusted or polished glaze. A bright yellow-gold header carries bold, rounded lettering in red with an outline, and cartoon children holding hands in a ring or a golden mascot figure. Shapes are small, soft, chunky and animated. Mood is playful, sweet, sunny, nostalgic and instantly readable, with colour doing the shouting.'),
('Pocky (Glico)','East Asia','1970s-present','confectionery','In the style of Pocky, slim, long, elegant forms with one end left bare as a handle, presented in narrow sleeve packs. Saturated single-colour fields in red, pink and other flavour hues, each with a glossy lamination. Cute close-up food photography shows thin sticks dipped halfway in a smooth glaze, with a bright white wave or splash. Bold rounded lettering mixes Japanese and Latin characters. Palette is cheerful pastel and primary, with small flavour icons. Mood is clean, convenient, sweet, fun and collectable, with limited-edition variations.'),
('Meiji','East Asia','1960s-present','confectionery','In the style of Meiji, tidy, friendly, nostalgic Japanese convenience design in red, chocolate brown, cream and white. Bright red sleeves with a white script mark, silver foil inners, and clean cream panels carry a small simple illustration. Flat cartoon drawings of woodland scenes in pale yellow and brown, rounded fonts, small bilingual text and orderly panel dividers on a simple grid. Charming snack shapes pair a narrow stem with a chocolate cap. Mood is clean, cheerful, gentle and reassuring.'),
('Kikkoman','East Asia','1960s-present','food','In the style of Kikkoman, practical, precise and restrained table design with a drip-free sense of function. A tall, narrow, softly curved and faceted glass body holds a dark amber-brown liquid, topped with a red cap and a conical spout in a hexagonal outline. Plain white labels carry a bold red-and-black hexagonal crest, black and red calligraphic lettering and a thin gold border. Palette is deep red, black, white and amber. Clean, ergonomic, understated, and instantly recognisable at a glance across a table.'),
('Lea & Perrins','Europe','1840s-present','food','In the style of Lea & Perrins, fussy, crowded Victorian heritage pantry design. A squat rectangular glass vessel with a short neck is wrapped in cream-white paper printed in black, with ornate Victorian serif and slab lettering mixed with fine engraved text, plus an orange-ochre label and a small coat-of-arms-like crest. Paper seals, folded wrapping and a black cap add craft detail. Palette is orange, black and cream with an aged, tea-stained patina. Mood is old English, authentic, reassuring and quietly traditional, with dense, symmetrical labelling.'),
('Marmite','Europe','1920s-present','food','In the style of Marmite, blunt, comic, strong two-tone design that shouts from the shelf. A squat, round-shouldered, stout silhouette like a small cauldron, with a broad base, wide mouth and ridges at the shoulder. Glossy bright yellow fields meet dark navy or black bands, with deep red and brown accents. Lettering is chunky white serif capitals with a scrolled feel. Form is simple, heavy and instantly memorable. Mood is cheeky, confident, unapologetic and wonderfully recognisable, polarising yet beloved.'),
('Heinz','North America','1900s-present','food','In the style of Heinz, heritage American pantry design with tidy, symmetrical labels. A keystone-shaped cream label with a tomato-red border and a bold vertical stripe of red carries white or cream serif lettering. Decorative touches include ornate serif capitals, banner ribbons, fine print and a small pickle-shaped emblem. Forms are tall and narrow with a long neck and faceted shoulders in glass, with metal caps. A vivid blue stripe accents the range. Palette is tomato red, cream, gold and blue. Mood is wholesome, proud and old-fashioned.'),
('Campbell','North America','1900s-present','food','In the style of Campbell, plain, flat, symmetrical and repetitive, a uniform grid of identical cylinders on a shelf. A bright red upper two-thirds meets a white lower third, divided by a thin gold band. A gold medallion seal with scalloped edges sits at the centre with small ornamental flanking details. The main mark is a thin red connected looping script, with white sans-serif capitals for secondary text on the red field. Palette is red, white and gold. Mood is simple, reliable, nostalgic and instantly legible, like a comforting pantry staple.'),
('Tabasco','North America','1900s-present','food','In the style of Tabasco, slim, tiny, hand-labelled heritage with a narrow bottle form, long neck, flat shoulder and small rounded base. Vivid fire-engine red-orange contents glow through clear glass, capped in green with a small dropper insert. Labels layer a deep green oval neck band and a red diamond centre with white serif capitals and a thin gold border. Cap colours vary to show variants. Palette is fiery red, forest green, cream and gold. Mood is spicy, Southern, authentic and compact, with a diamond emblem on a slender body.'),
('Moleskine','Europe','1990s-present','stationery','In the style of Moleskine, sober, minimal and travel-worn elegance. Hard covers wrapped in black matte oilcloth-like material with rounded corners, a cloth bookmark ribbon, an elastic band closure and a back pocket. Cream-ivory pages, ruled or plain, with a sewn spine. A narrow black-and-white paper band wraps the outside with a small text insert. Thin sans-serif type, no embellishment, understated manufacturing detail. Palette is black on cream. Mood is urban, intellectual, tactile, practical and quietly artistic, ready to be filled with notes.'),
('Aesop','Oceania','2000s-present','cosmetics','In the style of Aesop, literate, apothecary-inspired restraint with quiet luxury. Amber brown glass or matte brown containers with plain cream-white paper labels, set in neat black type in a thin classical roman, followed by long detailed text lists. Black or brass pumps, squat jars and muted aluminium. Spaces use raw timber, concrete, brass sinks, stacked brown bottles and dim warm lighting. Palette is amber brown, cream, black and grey-green. Mood is tactile, thoughtful, minimal, sensory and understated, favouring texture and text over decoration.'),
('Lush','Europe','1990s-present','cosmetics','In the style of Lush, handmade, playful and messy, with products shown naked and piled on wood and wicker. Vivid pinks, greens, purples and blues in swirling marbled patterns, large hand-cut hunks, and bold handwritten black marker labels on kraft-brown or white stickers. Black plastic pots stamped with doodles, hand-lettered brush type, chalkboards, kraft wrapping and exposed timber with green and black decor. Open-fronted, abundant and sensory. Mood is bright, intense, fresh, irreverent, hand-made and joyfully imperfect.'),
('The Body Shop','Europe','1980s-90s','cosmetics','In the style of The Body Shop, earnest, earthy, ethical design in forest green and white. Painted forest-green fronts and shelves carry white lettering, with glossy dark green and white labels and plain clear plastic containers with simple matt caps and thin white type. Rows of small refill pots, jute and kraft bags, wicker baskets and hand-written stickers keep things natural. Small simple illustrations depict natural ingredients. Palette is green, white and natural fibre tones. Mood is honest, practical, utilitarian, friendly and conscientious, with no gloss or luxury.'),
('Penhaligons','Europe','19th century-present','perfume','In the style of Penhaligons, ornate, quirky Victorian gentleman-perfumer elegance. Cut-crystal or clear glass with faceted stoppers, tied with ribbon and silken tassels, in heavy cream or deep green boxes with gold embossed crests. Wax-sealed collars, tissue wrapping and hat-box shapes. Labels are cream with gold borders and fine engraved Victorian serif, topped with a small animal emblem. Spaces use dark green panels, polished brass and glass-fronted wood cabinets. Palette is deep green, ivory, gold and burgundy. Mood is eccentric, refined, collectible and theatrical.'),
('Yardley','Europe','1900s-1960s','cosmetics','In the style of Yardley, soft, delicate English drugstore elegance from the 1930s to 1960s. A pale lilac and white palette with violet and purple printing, gold touches and cream surfaces. Woodcut-style vignettes of flower sellers in flowing curved compositions, copperplate script lettering and ornate border lines. Pastel metal lids, sifter tops and thick printed paper wrappers. Floral motifs and fine line illustration keep everything gentle. Mood is fragrant, ladylike, nostalgic, dainty and refined, with subtle floral romance.'),
('Chanel No 5 packaging','Europe','1920s-present','perfume','In the style of Chanel No 5 packaging, austere, geometric, Art Deco modernist luxury. Plain rectangular clear glass with chamfered corners and a short flat-sided faceted stopper, with pale golden contents. Flat white labels with a thin black border, black sans-serif capitals and a single numeral in a clean roman face. Plain white outer cartons with a black outline. Palette is black, white and clear glass with a touch of gold. Mood is precise, minimal, apothecary-like and quietly luxurious, with generous white space and no ornament.'),
('Starbucks','North America','1990s-present','cafe','In the style of Starbucks, cosy, living-room warmth with mellow, consistent lighting. A circular green emblem holds a white twin-tailed crowned figure inside a ring of lettering, in green, white and black. White cups carry a green mark with brown cardboard sleeves, and staff wear matt green aprons. Spaces use warm wood, dark brown woodwork, soft pendant lights, leather armchairs, chalkboard menus and glass display cases. Palette is forest green, espresso brown, cream and black. Mood is welcoming, comfortable, familiar and relaxed.'),
('Pret a Manger','Europe','1990s-present','cafe','In the style of Pret a Manger, brisk, tidy, natural urban freshness. A deep burgundy-maroon lowercase rounded sans-serif wordmark on white, with brushed stainless steel counters, glass-fronted cabinets and stacked wooden crates. Clear cartons with kraft paper trim, brown paper bags, and cream cups with a thin maroon line. Bright interiors have exposed brick, white tile, small chalk-style tags and orderly rows of fresh food. Palette is maroon, silver, white and kraft brown. Mood is clean, efficient, honest, light and modern.'),
('Trader Joes','North America','1990s-present','retail','In the style of Trader Joes, friendly, quirky, nautical-tiki neighbourhood charm with a Hawaiian shirt casualness. Wood-panelled walls, hand-lettered chalkboard signs and hand-drawn cartoon illustrations of boats and fish. A red brush-script logo on white, bright own-label packaging with playful, witty copy, kraft brown paper bags with a red mark, and a tropical bell. Palette is bright red, cream, kraft brown and navy. Mood is personal, humorous, cheerful, small-scale and handmade, with an informal, welcoming tone.'),
('Harrods','Europe','1900s-present','retail','In the style of Harrods, opulent, ceremonial, theatrical British luxury. A grand Edwardian terracotta-fronted facade in cream stone, outlined at night with hundreds of tiny electric lights, with green awnings and gilded signage. Thick paper bags in green and gold with ribbon handles and a plain gold serif wordmark. Interiors of marble, polished brass, deep green carpet and ornate plaster ceilings, plus exotic themed halls with gold sphinx figures and hieroglyph panels. Palette is racing green, gold, cream and terracotta. Mood is grand, rich and showy.'),
('Selfridges','Europe','1900s-present','retail','In the style of Selfridges, theatrical, showy retail-as-entertainment. A monumental Edwardian stone facade with giant Ionic columns, a central clock and a bronze sculpture over the entrance, with large display windows staged as dramatic scenes. Bold flat yellow bags with a plain black sans-serif capital wordmark, and bright, plain signage. Interiors blend classical stonework with modern white displays. Palette is yellow, black, white and stone. Mood is confident, playful, daring and instantly recognisable, pairing heavy classical grandeur with flat, graphic modern colour.'),
('Galeries Lafayette','Europe','1900s-present','retail','In the style of Galeries Lafayette, Belle Epoque grandeur, ornate and light-filled. A central Art Nouveau glass and steel dome in stained-glass colours of gold, green and amber rises above tiers of balconies with curved wrought-iron balustrades in gilded patterns. Cream stone facades with ornate carving, gold lettering, mosaic floors, sweeping staircases and glass canopies. Pale pink or cream bags carry thin black capital letters. Palette is gold, cream, emerald and amber. Mood is Parisian, decorative, luminous and grand, with ironwork and coloured glass.'),
('Laduree','Europe','1860s-present','confectionery','In the style of Laduree, dainty, sugary Second Empire Parisian tearoom elegance. Pastel colours in pistachio green, rose pink, lilac, vanilla yellow and coffee brown, arranged in neat stacked pyramids. Boxes in pale mint or pink with gold embossed script, gilt edges, satin ribbon and tissue. Interiors use powder-blue and pistachio paintwork, gilded mouldings, painted ceilings of cherubs, marble tables and glass cabinets. Cursive gold lettering, a delicate oval crest and floral flourishes. Palette is pistachio, rose, cream and gold. Mood is ornate, gilded, feminine and delicate.'),
('Fauchon','Europe','1880s-present','food','In the style of Fauchon, glossy, high-fashion French delicatessen with striking contrasts. Shiny hot fuchsia-pink and black with gold, in rectangular forms with thick laminated finishes and sleek geometry. Logotype in thin white or gold serif capitals within a rich black panel, with ribbons in fuchsia and cream. Displays line up luxury goods in tidy rows against black and pink. Palette is fuchsia pink, black, gold and white. Mood is bold, sophisticated, theatrical, luxurious and slightly cheeky, with refined Parisian polish.'),
('Sprungli','Europe','1840s-present','confectionery','In the style of Sprungli, genteel, understated Swiss confectionery craft, delicate and refined. Soft pastel boxes in turquoise-blue, silver and cream, with small items nestled in pleated paper cups. Wordmark in a clean, thin, spaced serif in silver or white on pale aqua, with fine linear borders. Tall elegant tearoom interiors with pale marble tables, mirrored walls and polished wooden bars. Palette is pale aqua, silver, cream and chocolate brown. Mood is calm, gracious, quietly luxurious and carefully restrained, preferring quality and delicacy over show.'),
('Raffles Hotel','Southeast Asia','1890s-1930s','hotel','In the style of Raffles Hotel, tropical colonial grace, airy, cool and symmetrical. A white building with long arcades, Renaissance-style facade, tall arched windows, black-and-white tiles, bright green lawns and tall palms. Wide verandas with louvred shutters, ceiling fans, rattan chairs, dark teak and polished brass. Dining spaces use white linen and patterned Peranakan tile floors. Staff wear crisp white uniforms with turban-like caps. Palette is white, deep green, teak brown and brass. Mood is gracious, leisurely, old-world and refined.'),
('Savoy Hotel','Europe','1920s-30s','hotel','In the style of Savoy Hotel, streamlined, glamorous 1930s Art Deco in black, silver, gold and ivory. Chromed trim, stepped geometric mouldings, curved glass, mirrored panels and sleek brass. A tall gold figure on a column and a steel canopy mark the entrance. Interiors use silver leaf, stylised sunburst motifs, lacquered woodwork, plush deep carpets and curving staircases. Bold symmetry and lustrous materials create drama. Mood is polished, elegant, confident and theatrical, with crisp stepped geometry throughout.'),
('Pan Am','North America','1950s-70s','airline','In the style of Pan Am, mid-century jet-age optimism and worldly glamour. Gleaming bare-metal surfaces with a white upper area and a single thin sky-blue line that sweeps along. A deep blue circle encloses a globe marked with latitude lines. Lowercase bold sans-serif lettering in blue, clean and modern. Light blue and white bags and posters in cobalt blue, white and sky-blue. Palette is azure, white and metallic silver. Mood is clean, confident, modern, adventurous and international, with the globe as the guiding motif.'),
('British Airways','Europe','1980s-90s','airline','In the style of British Airways, flag-waving, formal, traditional pride in navy, red, white and silver. A white upper area with a navy lower portion and a bold red-and-blue swoosh-like band, and a billowing flag-like pattern of red, white and blue stripes in a rippling shape. Lettering is bold navy capitals in clean sans-serif. Interiors in dove grey and navy with red stitching and patterned fabrics. Earlier designs used red and blue wedges as speed lines. Mood is confident, orderly, dignified and national.'),
('Air India','South Asia','1960s-2000s','airline','In the style of Air India, warm, ornate, regal Indian palace feeling in crimson, white, saffron and gold. A polished white body carries a red-orange and white stripe, and a stylised red swan or archer disc emblem. Windows are framed in painted Indian arch shapes in red. Interiors feature carved pillars, Mughal-inspired arches and crimson and gold fabrics. A bowing, turbaned, moustached mascot character welcomes everyone with hospitality. Mood is hospitable, decorative, courtly and vibrant, blending modern sleekness with ornate tradition.'),
('JAL','East Asia','1960s-2000s','airline','In the style of JAL, minimal, refined, precise and symbolic Japanese restraint. A white body with a dark grey stripe, a red rising-sun circle, and a stylised red crane in flight formed from a circle and three sweeping lines. A thin red stripe pairs with a grey band. Lettering is clean, slim grey sans-serif with a red circle. Palette is red, white and slate grey. Mood is disciplined, crisp, elegant and quietly proud, based on a single circle-and-arc emblem and generous calm space.'),
('Swissair','Europe','1950s-90s','airline','In the style of Swissair, rigorous Swiss International Style, precise, flat, orderly and bold. A strong red field carries a white cross within a square, repeated everywhere. Rounded sans-serif lettering in white or red, lowercase headlines, strict grid layouts and clean photography. Bare metal and white surfaces, with interiors in clean red, white and grey and the cross on small items. Palette is bright red, white, silver and grey. Mood is neutral, efficient, trustworthy, modernist and graphic.'),
('Lufthansa','Europe','1960s-present','airline','In the style of Lufthansa, orderly, efficient, geometric modernism and strictly typographic. A dark navy field carries a canary yellow circular disc enclosing a bird in flight drawn in just a few strokes, like a seal. Lettering is dark blue, clean and sober sans-serif. A thin blue stripe appears on the lower body in earlier variants. Yellow and blue are paired throughout, with cobalt seats and grey interiors. Palette is deep navy, canary yellow, white and grey. Mood is precise, reliable, calm and corporate.'),
('SAS','Europe','1970s-90s','airline','In the style of SAS, crisp, Nordic, functional, cool and modest. White surfaces with a deep navy area, a slim blue and red line, and a clean humanist sans-serif wordmark in lowercase or capitals. An emblem with a simplified compass-like or longship hint is drawn in minimal shape. Interiors use grey, blue and pale wood in tidy Scandinavian design. Palette is navy blue, white, red and grey. Mood is understated, practical and well-ordered, with clean geometry and tidy typography.'),
('KLM','Europe','1960s-present','airline','In the style of KLM, cheerful, friendly, regal and sunny, cool pastel blue overall. A light sky-blue upper area with a white lower area carries a blue and white crown emblem above rounded serif or sans lettering. Small items appear in light blue, white and gold, including miniature blue glazed ceramic canal-house models with numbered labels. Palette is sky blue, white and gold with a deep blue ring. Mood is warm, courteous, proudly Dutch and approachable, mixing royal crown with playful hospitality.'),
('Emirates','Middle East','2000s-present','airline','In the style of Emirates, lavish, polished desert-luxury. A gleaming white body with bright red accents and red lettering in flowing Arabic calligraphy across the top, matched by a Latin wordmark in red. Interiors use gold-trimmed gradients, deep burgundy leather, wood-panelled accents, dark carpet and ambient mood lighting with a starry ceiling. Crew wear beige and red with a veiled cap. Palette is red, white, gold, beige and warm wood. Mood is rich, glamorous, hospitable and grand, with swooping script and shiny surfaces.'),
('Singapore Airlines','Southeast Asia','1970s-present','airline','In the style of Singapore Airlines, graceful, hospitable, tropical elegance. A white-silver body with a dark navy area, a gold stylised bird with swept wings forming a long arc, a single gold stripe and navy band. Crew wear close-fitting floral sarong-style dresses in dark blue with batik-style patterns of white and gold. Interiors use cream leather, warm wood and soft gold lighting. Palette is navy, gold, cream and white. Mood is serene, attentive, luxurious and refined, with swept lines and rich batik print.'),
('Qantas','Oceania','1970s-present','airline','In the style of Qantas, sunny, friendly, sporty and bold. A bright white body with a vivid red area carries a stylised white animal silhouette in mid-leap inside a rounded shape, and a red wordmark in clean, upright capitals. A thin red line sweeps below. Interiors use warm earthy tones such as terracotta and sand, inspired by the outback. Palette is red, white, silver and ochre. Mood is open, optimistic, energetic and confident, with a dynamic leaping silhouette in white against strong red.'),
('Aeroflot','Russia and Eastern Europe','1960s-80s','airline','In the style of Aeroflot, Soviet utilitarian, solid, no-nonsense. Bare polished aluminium surfaces with a thick pale blue stripe, a white winged emblem, and a red flag carrying a gold hammer-and-sickle-style device within two wings, heavy and bold. Large Cyrillic condensed capitals painted across the side. Interiors in drab greens and greys, patterned curtains and thick velour seats. Palette is silver, light blue, red and olive green. Mood is sturdy, functional, imposing and unadorned, with big letters and a heavy winged emblem.'),
('Waffle House','North America','1960s-present','restaurant','In the style of Waffle House, functional, all-night, highway roadside, flat and strongly lit. A bold yellow rectangular sign on tall poles carries black capital letters in a square slab face. Low box buildings with yellow and black trim, big windows, a bright interior with a long counter, stools, harsh overhead light and a checkered floor. Laminated menus with food photos on black and yellow. Palette is lemon yellow, black, white and chrome. Mood is plain, no-frills, familiar, fast and always open.'),
('In-N-Out','North America','1950s-present','restaurant','In the style of In-N-Out, clean, retro California drive-in, bright and uncluttered. White surfaces with a red roof stripe, a pair of crossed yellow arrow-like palm shapes, and a bright red and yellow arrow sign pointing down. Red and white tiled interiors, red and white paper wrappers, striped trays and small white paper hats. Menus on a simple white board with red lettering. Palette is red, white, yellow and a touch of palm green. Mood is fresh, simple, sunny, wholesome and proudly minimal.'),
('McDonalds','North America','1970s-present','restaurant','In the style of McDonalds, bright, fast, family-friendly, built on a high-contrast red and golden yellow pair that reads quickly. A pair of golden arches forms a bold, curved double-arched letter in yellow over red, with a symmetrical logo and bold signage. Packaging in red and yellow, with paper wrappers, red cartons, and white cups with a red-and-yellow band. Interiors use moulded plastic seats in orange and red, tiled floors and bright counters. Mood is cheerful, standardised, instantly recognisable and energetic.'),
('Nandos','Europe','1990s-present','restaurant','In the style of Nandos, warm, bold, casual, spicy and lively. Terracotta, warm earth and chilli red, with a bold stylised rooster mascot, a chilli pepper motif and a flame theme. Interiors use exposed brick, colourful African-inspired art, chunky wooden tables, rich red paint and mixed patterned tiles. Menus and packaging in red, black, cream and orange with bold angular lettering and hand-drawn rooster art. Palette is chilli red, black, cream, orange and brown. Mood is folk-art, welcoming, fiery and bright, with heritage patterns from Portuguese and African influences.'),
('Yo Sushi','Europe','1990s-2000s','restaurant','In the style of Yo Sushi, playful, futuristic, pop-culture Japan-inspired and brisk. Sleek spaces with a long conveyor belt carrying small colour-coded plates, slick white tables, glossy surfaces, plastic stools and neon lighting. Bright hot pink, red and black signage with bubbly lettering, and large manga-style cartoon characters. Plates in various colours indicate price. Palette is hot pink, red, black, white and neon blue. Mood is kinetic, fun, youthful, cartoonish and energetic, with bright graphic accents.'),
('Wagamama','Europe','1990s-present','restaurant','In the style of Wagamama, austere, canteen-like Japanese-influenced minimalism with a cheerful bustle. Long communal wooden benches in a bright minimal hall with white walls, black lacquer bowls and red-trimmed signage. A red square stamp-like logo holds a simple black character. Menus on thin paper in black and red in a hand-written style. Food is served in large bowls with simple utensils. Palette is black, red, white and pale wood. Mood is clean, fast, sociable, plain and efficient.'),
('Bata','Europe','1930s-present','fashion','In the style of Bata, modernist, utilitarian, bright and everyday. A bold red rectangular sign carries white hand-lettered script, with glass windows, goods on pale shelves and a flat functional layout. Boxes in red and white with a diagonal stripe and a small white label, plain and sturdy. Simple profiles, rubber soles and a hint of functional modernism. Concrete and glass buildings repeat in a regular grid. Palette is red, white and grey. Mood is practical, democratic, orderly and straightforward, with a simple scripted wordmark in red.'),
('Parle-G','South Asia','1980s-present','confectionery','In the style of Parle-G, bright, nostalgic, wholesome mass-market Indian design on a bold sunshine yellow field. A cartoon smiling toddler girl with dark hair and a round face sits in an oval frame, edged in red and white. Lettering is bold red and white sans-serif, combining Indian and Latin scripts. Surfaces are flat, glossy and high-contrast, with a red banner and a photograph of the product. Palette is sunshine yellow, red, white and black. Mood is friendly, familiar, affordable and cheerful, with a baby mascot.'),
('Frooti','South Asia','1980s-present','beverages','In the style of Frooti, juicy, cheerful, summery and kid-friendly. Bright mango-yellow and green fields carry a glossy printed picture of ripe tropical fruit with leaves. A bold red and white curved wordmark in a bubbly rounded cartoon font. Compact shapes have rounded edges and creases, with a small straw attached to the side. Palette is mango yellow, orange, green and red. Mood is fruity, tropical, high-contrast and playful, with a bold fruit picture and bubbly type.'),
('Limca','South Asia','1970s-present','beverages','In the style of Limca, refreshing, tangy, sunny and citrus-fresh. A lime-green body with a bright white and yellow label, a swirly lime-green and white wordmark in a rounded bold font, and a graphic of halved citrus fruit with droplets. Labels carry a sunburst of lemon yellow behind the lettering and a thin curved line. Condensation and ice emphasise coolness. Palette is lime green, bright yellow, white and a touch of blue. Mood is zesty, lively, crisp and vibrant, with rounded type.'),
('Inca Kola','Latin America','1960s-present','beverages','In the style of Inca Kola, sunny, festive, Andean and luminous. A glowing golden-yellow colour fills clear glass, with yellow and red labels and a bold red banner. A circular emblem holds a sun-face and stepped pre-Columbian geometric shapes in red, black and gold. Lettering is chunky sans-serif with decorative stepped edges. Palette is canary yellow, red, black and white. Mood is joyful, proud, rooted in ancient geometric motifs and bright, with stepped patterns and a glowing yellow.'),
('Guarana Antarctica','Latin America','1970s-present','beverages','In the style of Guarana Antarctica, tropical, Brazilian, sunny and energetic. A vibrant leafy green body with a bold yellow and red label shows a ring of bright red berries with black seeds, with a round badge in the centre bearing a polar animal silhouette. Lettering is white and yellow rounded sans-serif with a thin black outline. Glossy graphics and rounded friendly layouts. Palette is leafy green, golden yellow, scarlet red and white. Mood is fruity, lively, warm and approachable.'),
('Tsingtao','East Asia','1900s-present','beverages','In the style of Tsingtao, traditional, slightly old-fashioned Chinese-German colonial heritage with neat label borders. A green body with a tall neck carries a cream oval label edged in green, an illustrated landmark of a small pavilion on a rocky shore in dark green, and a red and green wordmark in classical lettering. Green caps and a red seal accent. Palette is dark green, cream, red and gold. Mood is orderly, proud, heritage and refined, with an illustrated landmark and classical type.'),
('Wang Lao Ji','East Asia','2000s-present','beverages','In the style of Wang Lao Ji, auspicious, celebratory and traditional Chinese. A bright festival red surface covered in golden brush calligraphy, with a golden border of traditional ornamental patterns and gold-coloured accents. A large central bold brush script sits on a plain, slightly glossy red field. Palette is festival red, gold and white. Mood is cheerful, lucky, festive and bold, with strong colour blocks, calligraphic marks and gilded trim.'),
('Nescafe','Europe','1960s-present','beverages','In the style of Nescafe, bold, familiar, warm and morning-friendly. A squat round body with a bright red screw-top lid and a red label with white lettering, a shield-like or rounded red badge, and a cream window revealing the contents. Lettering is a rounded bold sans-serif in white on red with a slim outline. Steam swirls rise above warm drinks. Palette is bright red, white, brown and cream. Mood is comforting, clear, friendly and reassuring, with a strong red and white label.'),
('Milo','Oceania','1960s-present','beverages','In the style of Milo, sporty, energetic, wholesome, vibrant and child-friendly. A cylindrical form with a bright apple-green background, a white and dark-green band with bold lettering in a rounded font, and a picture of an athletic child in action in sports gear. Green appears across sachets, cartons and cans, with dusty chocolate-brown tones for the contents. Palette is apple green, dark green, white and brown. Mood is active, healthy and optimistic, with action poses and a bold green block.'),
('Braun','Europe','1950s-70s','electronics','In the style of Braun, calm, rational, ornament-free functional design. Simple geometric volumes with softly rounded corners, tight even gaps and precise tolerances. Matte or satin surfaces in off-white, pale grey, black and graphite, with natural light wood or clear panels used sparingly. Any controls are small, round or flush and neatly grouped on a strict grid, with a single tiny accent of orange, yellow, green or red marking the one key function. Lettering is thin, small and evenly spaced in clean grotesque sans-serif. Fine perforations or slots add texture where needed. Nothing decorative, generous empty space, honest, quiet and understated.'),
('Apple','North America','2000s-present','electronics','In the style of Apple, minimalist, seamless, premium and calm. Thin slab forms with uniformly rounded corners and continuous tight radii, milled or brushed aluminium in silver, space grey, gold and soft pastel anodised colours, with edge-to-edge glass and thin black bezels. Early work uses glossy white polycarbonate. No visible screws, almost no buttons, only a few precisely cut slim controls, and circular lenses grouped neatly. A small polished silhouette logo sits centred. Type is clean sans-serif with generous white space, soft translucent blur layers and glossy rounded icons. Packaging is white and sparse.'),
]
